00180Ar 2               @rec_la_dot:
00180Ar 2               ; Chained LHS: TOS = &cur_record_base. Walk into nested records as long
00180Ar 2               ; as the field is RECORD-typed and another '.' follows; the final scalar
00180Ar 2               ; field becomes the STIND target.
00180Ar 2  AD rr rr             LDA     sym_save_vmask
