002833r 2  20 rr rr             JSR     emit_byte
002836r 2  68                   PLA
002837r 2  20 rr rr             JSR     emit_byte
00283Ar 2  A5 rr                LDA     scratch
00283Cr 2  20 rr rr             JSR     emit_byte
